[?2004l[?2004h>    "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS FOR DOWN PAYMENT".
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> PROCEDURE DIVISION.
[?2004l[?2004h>     OPEN INPUT INFILE
[?2004l[?2004h>     OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE.
